+# Plervo TLS provider source pin
+
+Source: https://github.com/RustCrypto/rustls-rustcrypto/tree/70f76c039e587192688af18a80d5d6435dedaf22
+
+Library source and tests are unchanged from this immutable upstream revision.
+MIT/Apache-2.0 notices are retained. The previous crate release used the old
+RustCrypto arithmetic stack affected by RUSTSEC-2026-0387. This snapshot supports
+the maintained RustCrypto APIs; the manifest adds a crypto-bigint 0.7.9 minimum.
+No cryptographic algorithm is implemented or patched by Plervo.
+The application still rejects TLS client private keys. Ephemeral key exchange
+uses secrets, so that restriction alone was not a mitigation for this advisory.
+
+Original archive SHA-256: 37d98d7410906e203266e29ba8714971f186ce5b97c25b1798688a48ca5637a8
